WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.581
The Product summary tab on Products shows every part John Deere ordered, with its quantities and revenue.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:11.189
Search a part, and click its part number to open the product summary.

00:00:14.523 --> 00:00:20.432
At the top you see the MOQ, the pack, the vendors, and the P Os and orders of the part.

00:00:20.884 --> 00:00:28.152
Six numbers follow the part: total ordered, delivered to Deere, in transit, dispatched, and what is still pending.

00:00:28.603 --> 00:00:35.941
Revenue shows the value of what was ordered, dispatched and delivered, and Vendors and prices shows each vendor's price.

00:00:36.392 --> 00:00:41.733
By PO lists each PO of the part, with what was ordered, dispatched and delivered.
